# Expo mobile UI

When building or changing UI in `apps/mobile`, always read and follow
`.agents/skills/expo-ui/SKILL.md` (and `.agents/skills/expo-native-ui/SKILL.md` for layout/HIG),
`DESIGN.md`, and `docs/reference-app.png`.

- `DESIGN.md` is the source of truth for tokens, type, spacing, shape, and interaction
- `docs/reference-app.png` is the look-and-feel reference — open it and match layout,
  photography, hierarchy, warmth, and density
- Prefer `@expo/ui` for BottomSheet, pickers, menus, toggles, grouped lists
- Use SwiftUI (`@expo/ui/swift-ui`) for ConfirmationDialog, ContextMenu, DatePicker, Alert —
  only in `src/components/**/*.ios.tsx` (never under `app/`)
- Custom RN components for cards, search, chips, screens — not React Native Paper or shadcn
- Component placement (see CLAUDE.md): shared → `src/components/` (`ui/`, chrome);
  route-only → `app/<route>/_components/`; native overlays stay in `src/components/native/`
